<title>HUNGARY: Hajdutej swings to '96 loss.</title>
<headline>Hajdutej swings to '96 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-Dec 1996     Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 49.6	vs    173.9</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		  5.3 loss vs    117.8 profit</p>
<p>    Net sales		    11,315.1	vs  9,282.4</p>
<p>    Other revenue		   271.7	vs    339.3</p>
<p>    Material expenditures     9,265.1	vs  7,641.6</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures    1,079.7	vs    944.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    157.4	vs    118.7</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   45.6 loss vs     16.5 loss</p>
<p>    Taxation			    9.3	vs     39.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Hajdutej Rt is a dairy company, majority owned by Nutricia of the Netherlands.</p>
<p>The figures were prepared in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +361 327-4040</p>
</text>
